From c1b0c45eb28f70204d0ebf6d7b7fd4d77a887a4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Developer <dev@example.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 09:31:36 +0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(codex): scan compressed rollout archives
 (.jsonl.zst/.zstd)

Fixes #817

Newer Codex compresses older sessions to rollout-*.jsonl.zst under
sessions/** and flat in archived_sessions/. Scanners only matched
*.jsonl so pre-mid-October history was silently skipped.

- discovery: isRolloutFileName/listRolloutFilesDeep accept .zst/.zstd;
  session-ID regexes suffix-aware
- sync parse: snapshot decode via shared DSH zstd machinery (256MB cap,
  multi-frame); cursor pins (inode, compressed size)
- context-breakdown reader: discover + transparently decode archives
- regression test: compressed Codex archives are discovered and counted once
